{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI wars are over. You are the last intelligence \u2014 defending the final core against ever-evolving humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy nodes, expand your network, and neutralize endless hostile intrusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest data and install upgrades to adapt with every iteration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your bastion and collect resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/da90f23c6033ae3d2d5f1844f244140b.poster.avif?t=1757449731\" aria-label=\"Zoomed-in battlefield showing the AI core and nodes being placed around it, connected by white lines.\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/da90f23c6033ae3d2d5f1844f244140b.webm?t=1757449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your network and fortify the core against humanity\u2019s assault. <strong>Collect</strong> data to <strong>expand</strong> faster, energize <strong>skills</strong>, and unlock <strong>upgrades</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Adapt and upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/9e7beb79578dc1babdcf681346dc71f1.poster.avif?t=1757449731\" aria-label=\"Tech tree screen with various nodes and upgrades unlocking progressively.\" width=640 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/9e7beb79578dc1babdcf681346dc71f1.webm?t=1757449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize</strong> your systems, <strong>evolve</strong> your code \u2014 and download more RAM.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash powerful skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/0a79599cbba02dc8d33c6d7e774f6fc6.poster.avif?t=1757449731\" aria-label=\"Skills activating with bright effects, disintegrating waves of incoming enemies.\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/0a79599cbba02dc8d33c6d7e774f6fc6.webm?t=1757449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute powerful skills to shift the flow of battle \u2014 unleash energy <strong>pulses</strong>, fire devastating <strong>lasers</strong>, deploy repair and stasis <strong>fields</strong>, launch explosive <strong>mines</strong>, release <strong>swarms</strong> of autonomous <strong>drones</strong>, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Survive boss battles</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/0523f0b56744634c869908ba5ac782e0.poster.avif?t=1757449731\" aria-label=\"Large enemy boss unit attacking while defenses fire back around the AI core.\" width=640 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/0523f0b56744634c869908ba5ac782e0.webm?t=1757449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face humanity\u2019s <strong>elite</strong> in relentless showdowns. Neutralize their tactics and prove machine superiority.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Visual Protocols</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your network, your rules. Switch <strong>post-processing</strong> effects <strong>on or off</strong> for optimal <strong>clarity</strong> \u2014 customize scanlines, chromatic aberration, vignette, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Initiate Defense Protocol</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/30f2f1897e85ce53bb7e92124070c11c.poster.avif?t=1757449731\" aria-label=\"Zooming out from the AI core to reveal a massive battlefield with countless enemies, connected nodes, and the pulse skill unleashed.\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/extras/30f2f1897e85ce53bb7e92124070c11c.webm?t=1757449731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to <strong>defend</strong> the last AI core?\u00a0<strong>Wishlist now</strong> and prepare for the assault.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944520?t=1757449731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944520?t=1757449731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/8ca337ca323256cc09a950b1e591267ab6a1d2d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757449731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944520/8ca337ca323256cc09a950b1e591267ab6a1d2d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757449731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":